        "id": 1002666
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-05T23:16:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it be better to return the [structured content](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-06-18/server/tools#structured-content) (and schema)?\n\nThen I don\u0027t think you\u0027d need the `DiffFormatter` class at all. Unless I\u0027m missing something, that seems like a simpler solution (that we can probably apply to most of these tools).\n\nIf you do this, then I think most of my other comments aren\u0027t applicable.",
      "revId": "f0b1a7a15b963de8b630cec57b9330dd837fea5f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
