        "id": 4710980
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-07T10:37:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "get_file_diff returns a typed result with an output schema. I kept the line numbering: Gerrit\u0027s /diff chunks carry no line numbers, so a model would have to add up the lengths of all earlier chunks. That count is what models get wrong, so each line entry carries its number in the new file. The change also folds unchanged lines more than context_lines away from a change, because /diff returns the whole file whatever context it is asked for.",
      "parentUuid": "eae1404c_c89c966f",
      "revId": "f0b1a7a15b963de8b630cec57b9330dd837fea5f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
